只输出严格JSON，恰好包含id（metadata.id原样）、summary_zh（15到140个Unicode字符，通常40到100字）、category（枚举）、tags（2到5个不重复关键词，每个最多30字符）、confidence（0到1，仅自评）、insufficient_evidence（布尔）、evidence（1到3个对象，每个恰好包含paragraph_id、fact）、limitations（0到5个字符串）。只选择输入中长度20至120字符的完整片段编号；fact是该片段支持的中文事实转述。不要输出quote，不要自行抄写、拼接、删改或补造引用。程序会按编号附上原文。一个编号只用一次；最多3条证据。不得增加字段。
摘要和limitations保留会改变功能意义的前提、平台例外和限制：设密码后才认证、页面保持打开才提醒、依赖外部组件、估算不等于保证。只写已实现功能，不将规划当完成。证据不足就标记，不编造。
图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"用于展示对话中读取的图片（read_image 结果）：DSH Web GUI 对话流专用 Read image 行，默认缩略图 + 页面内全精度放大层（缩放按钮/滚轮/1:1）· Displays images read in the conversation (read_image results) in the DSH Web GUI","id":"gh:1337578367","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-read-image-view","slug":"Yu-tao-Li/dsh-read-image-view","topics":["dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"用于展示对话中读取的图片（read_image 结果）：DSH Web GUI 对话流专用 Read image 行，默认缩略图 + 页面内全精度放大层（缩放按钮/滚轮/1:1）· Displays "},{"id":"p1s2","text":"images read in the conversation (read_image results) in the DSH Web GUI"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-read-image-view"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"[](https://github.com/Yu-tao-Li/dsh-read-image-view/actions/workflows/ci.yml) [](https://github.com/"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"Yu-tao-Li/dsh-read-image-view/releases)"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"中文 · English"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## 中文"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"**把 DSH 的 `read_image` 结果变成完整图片预览和可缩放画廊。** 长截图、宽图和透明图都能在对话里直接看；一次返回多张图片也不会遗漏。"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"纯客户端插件，零生产依赖，使用宿主提供的会话授权图片加载器。"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"### 安装与使用"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"在 DSH 插件市场搜索 **dsh-read-image-view**，安装后重启 Harness。命令行 Web 用户也可以运行："},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"随后重启 `dsh web`。让模型读取图片，点预览即可打开画廊。"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"**DSH Desktop：** 已在 Windows 11 虚拟机中验证 DSH Desktop 0.11.1，其内置 Harness 为 **0.2.0-rc.2**，使用桌面应用自己数据目录中的"},{"id":"p12s2","text":" **web profile**。优先在桌面应用内安装，再用 **Harness → 重启**。外部 CLI 的默认 DSH_HOME 可能指向另一套配置；使用 CLI 时须先指定桌面应用的实际 DS"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"H_HOME。桌面版已管理过的插件可能使用独立版本目录，外部 CLI 安装会在重启时被旧登记覆盖，因此升级请使用应用内插件管理。"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"如果宿主折叠了“已完成”或“已读取图片”的工具过程，先展开该过程。插件自己的图片行默认展开。"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"### 0.4.0 有什么改进"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"| 功能 | 用法 |"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"| 完整预览 | 长图和宽图按完整比例放进卡片，不截掉底部或右侧 |\n| 多图画廊 | 同次请求合并展示；一次工具结果里的所有图片均可切换 |\n| 缩放与平移 | 滚轮、＋/−、拖动、双指缩放；适应窗"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"口或 100% |\n| 键盘 | ←/→ 切图，＋/− 缩放，`0` 为 100%，`f` 适应，Esc 关闭 |\n| 焦点 | Tab/Shift+Tab 留在画廊内，关闭后返回打开图片的按钮 |\n"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"| 按需加载 | 接近视口才请求图片；失败可重试，关闭后异步结果不会重新弹出 |\n| 透明图 | 卡片和放大层均有棋盘格，便于辨认透明区域 |"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"**100% 的含义：** 一个宿主返回位图像素对应一个 CSS 像素。宿主可能先缩小或转换源图；插件会显示返回尺寸，并在元数据可用时标明源图尺寸。放大超过 100% 会插值，不会恢复已丢失的细节。高"},{"id":"p17s2","text":" DPI 屏幕的物理像素与 CSS 像素也不同。"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"### 实际桌面验证"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"以下为虚拟机中真实 DSH Desktop 渲染器截图，使用宿主真实附件存储和持久化会话。验证数据为人工构造的工具结果，未调用模型。"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"测试环境为 Windows 11 22621.4112、150% DPI。覆盖三张图片、失败结果、切图、100%、键盘焦点、Esc 和重复打开。另有 Chromium 自动回归覆盖 12000px 长"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"图、手机横竖屏、双指缩放、加载中关闭、重试和按需加载。"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"宿主实际拒绝 12000px 源图；桌面验证使用 600×8000 源图，宿主返回 561×7476 WEBP。插件遵守这条限制。兼容结论针对上述实测版本，其他宿主版本需要对应验证。"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"### 开发与资料"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"CI 运行纯逻辑与契约测试、bundle 同步检查和真实 Chromium 回归。`npm run e2e` 另需运行中的 DSH Web 会话。"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"源码入口：`src/client-src.js`；纯逻辑：`lib/read-image-core.mjs`；提交的发布 bundle：`lib/client.js`。加载、授权、缓存及 URL 生命"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"周期由 DSH 宿主管理；插件不新增文件读取权限或网络端点，TUI 工具数据不受影响。"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"20 项参考资料与采用理由 · 变更记录 · 发布流程 · MIT 许可"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## English"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"**Turn DSH `read_image` results into complete inline previews and a zoomable gallery.** View long sc"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"reenshots, panoramas and transparency in the conversation, including every image in a multi-image re"},{"id":"p28s3","text":"hots, panoramas and transparency in the conversation, including every image in a multi-image result."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"Client-only, with zero production dependencies and the host's session-authorized image loader."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"### Install and use"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"Search for **dsh-read-image-view** in the DSH plugin marketplace, install and restart Harness. For a"},{"id":"p31s2","text":" command-line Web installation:"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"Restart `dsh web`, ask the model to read an image, then click its preview."},{"id":"p34s1","text":"**DSH Desktop:** verified in a Windows 11 VM with DSH Desktop 0.11.1, embedding Harness **0.2.0-rc.2"},{"id":"p34s2","text":"**. It uses a **web profile** inside its own data directory. Prefer installing in the desktop app, t"},{"id":"p34s3","text":"hen **Harness → Restart**. An external CLI's default DSH_HOME may belong to a different installation"},{"id":"p34s4","text":"; set the desktop app's actual DSH_HOME before using CLI commands for it. Desktop also manages indep"},{"id":"p34s5","text":"endent plugin generations: a CLI install can be overwritten by the previously registered generation "},{"id":"p34s6","text":"on restart. Use the in-app plugin manager for upgrades."},{"id":"p35s1","text":"If the host collapses the completed turn or image-reading tool process, expand that process first. T"},{"id":"p35s2","text":"he plugin's image row defaults to expanded."},{"id":"p36s1","text":"### What's new in 0.4.0"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"| Feature | Interaction |"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"| Complete previews | Tall and wide images fit inside their cards without cropping |\n| Multi-image g"},{"id":"p38s2","text":"allery | Group reads within a request; navigate every image in each result |\n| Zoom and pan | Wheel,"},{"id":"p38s3","text":" +/−, drag and two-finger pinch; fit or 100% |\n| Keyboard | ←/→ navigate, +/− zoom, `0` for 100%, `f"},{"id":"p38s4","text":"` to fit, Esc to close |\n| Focus | Tab/Shift+Tab stay inside the gallery; closing restores the opene"},{"id":"p38s5","text":"r |\n| Deferred loading | Request images near the viewport; retry failures; late results cannot reope"},{"id":"p38s6","text":"n a closed gallery |\n| Transparency | Checkerboards in both cards and the gallery |"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"**100% means one returned bitmap pixel per CSS pixel.** The host can resize or convert the source fi"},{"id":"p39s2","text":"rst. The caption shows returned dimensions and source dimensions when provided. Zooming beyond 100% "},{"id":"p39s3","text":"interpolates the bitmap; it cannot recover discarded detail. Physical screen pixels also differ from"},{"id":"p39s4","text":" CSS pixels at high DPI."},{"id":"p40s1","text":"### Actual Desktop validation"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"These screenshots come from the actual DSH Desktop renderer in the VM, using the real host attachmen"},{"id":"p41s2","text":"t store and persisted session. Tool results were constructed as validation fixtures; no model calls "},{"id":"p41s3","text":"d persisted session. Tool results were constructed as validation fixtures; no model calls were made."},{"id":"p42s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
